<title>UK: Granada gets 104 mln stg for Hotel George V.</title>
<headline>Granada gets 104 mln stg for Hotel George V.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British media and leisure company Granada Group Plc said on Friday it completed the disposal of luxury Hotel George V in Paris to Saudi billionaire Prince al-Waleed bin Talal for a total of 104 million stg.</p>
<p>The plan to sell the hotel, part of Granada's divestment of its luxury hotels, was announced in December.</p>
<p>Granada's shares gained 11.5p to 857.5 by 1310 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
